title: "Passage of Meaning (词渡): Corpus-Backed Interactive Atlas of Chinese Word Histories and Semantic Change"
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhong"
    given-names: "Yuzhang"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yuzhang-zhong/passage-of-meaning"
